<h1 class="ink" style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:28px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.2px;color:#1b1a17;">Reset your password</h1>
