<tr><td class="card pad" bgcolor="#fefefe" style="background-color:#fefefe;border:1px solid #e6e6e9;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 24px 0;"><tr><td bgcolor="#fefefe" style="padding:0;background-color:#fefefe;border:1px solid #e6e6e9;border-radius:8px;line-height:0;font-size:0;"><img src="https://needt.app/icon-192.png" width="30" height="30" alt="Needt" style="display:block;width:30px;height:30px;border:0;border-radius:7px;color:#1b1a17;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:30px;"></td></tr></table>
<h1 class="ink" style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:28px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.2px;color:#1b1a17;">Confirm your university email</h1>
<p class="body" style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#47453f;">Someone added this address to a Needt account to get the student price on Pro: 40% off monthly and yearly.</p><p class="body" style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#47453f;">If that was you, confirm it below.</p><!--[if mso]><v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" href="https://use.needt.app/api/students/confirm?t=SAMPLE" style="height:44px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:119px;" arcsize="18%" stroke="f" fillcolor="#1b1a17"><w:anchorlock/><center style="color:#fefefe;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;">Confirm</center></v:roundrect><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 12px 0;"><tr><td class="btn" align="center" bgcolor="#1b1a17" style="background-color:#1b1a17;border:1px solid #1b1a17;border-radius:8px;"><a href="https://use.needt.app/api/students/confirm?t=SAMPLE" class="btn-a" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fefefe;text-decoration:none;">Confirm</a></td></tr></table><!--<![endif]--><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6e6b64;">Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="https://use.needt.app/api/students/confirm?t=SAMPLE" class="muted" target="_blank" style="color:#6e6b64;word-break:break-all;">https://use.needt.app/api/students/confirm?t=SAMPLE</a></p><p class="muted" style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6e6b64;">The link works for 24 hours. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email and nothing changes.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 0 0;"><tr><td class="hair" style="padding:16px 0 0 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e9;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6e6b64;">You get this because of activity on your Needt account.</p><p class="muted" style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6e6b64;">Needt &middot; needt.app</p></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Confirm your university email for Needt",
  "text": "Confirm your university email

Someone added this address to a Needt account to get the student price on Pro: 40% off monthly and yearly.

If that was you, confirm it below.

Confirm: https://use.needt.app/api/students/confirm?t=SAMPLE

The link works for 24 hours. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email and nothing changes.

--
You get this because of activity on your Needt account.
Needt - needt.app",
}
`;

