  "subject": "Your Pro trial ends in 3 days",
  "text": "Your Pro trial ends in 3 days

Your Needt Pro trial ends in 3 days. Choose Pro to keep Pro features after that.

If you do nothing, your account moves to Free and everything you made stays where it is.

Choose Pro: https://use.needt.app/settings#billing

--
You get this because you have a Needt account. Unsubscribe: https://use.needt.app/api/email/unsubscribe?t=SAMPLE
Needt - Example Operator, 1 Example Street, Example City",
}
`;

