<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;mso-hide:all;">One tap and Needt is yours. The link works once and expires in 24 hours.&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; </div>
