  "subject": "Confirm your email to start 14 days of Pro",
  "text": "Confirm your email

Hi Alex,

Confirm your email to open Needt and start 14 days of Pro, no card needed.

Confirm email: https://use.needt.app/auth/confirm-email?token=SAMPLE

This one-time link expires in 24 hours. If you did not create a Needt account, you can ignore this email.

--
You get this because of activity on your Needt account.
Needt - needt.app",
}
`;

